{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09900","headline":"送严维下第还江东 · 岑参","name":"送严维下第还江东","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"勿叹今不第，似君殊未迟。\n且归沧洲去，相送青门时。\n望鸟指乡远，问人愁路疑。\n敝裘沾暮雪，归櫂带流澌。\n严子滩复在，谢公文可追。\n江臯如有信，莫不寄新诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09900.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09900","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}